  "description": "This makes a total of 3 servings of Garlic and Bacon Brussels Sprouts. Each serving comes out to be 413 calories, 35.5g fats, 9.2g net carbs, and 12.8g protein.",
  "servings": 3,
  "yield": [
    "3",
    "3 servings"
  ],
  "prepTime": "PT10M",
